agraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/25997a6dbab0101ea1e0872a3a3b807e.poster.avif?t=1759193813\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/25997a6dbab0101ea1e0872a3a3b807e.webm?t=1759193813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/25997a6dbab0101ea1e0872a3a3b807e.mp4?t=1759193813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters in each night, survive as long as you can! Nocturnal Survivors is a single player survivor-like auto-shooter game in which you simply keep combining your weapons to more powerful versions to kill thousands of monsters at nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite maps with day-night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep weapon combination system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre and powerful artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More roguelike experience from random interactable objects and elite monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update v1.0 will be available on Sep 30.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
